end to end. Each shows one mechanism AMD used, with the numbers it reports.&lt;/p&gt;\n &lt;/div&gt;\n\n &lt;div class=&quot;rail&quot; id=&quot;rail&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;button class=&quot;rseg&quot; data-i=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rbar&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rfill&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rtxt&quot;&gt;01 Sparsity&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;button class=&quot;rseg&quot; data-i=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rbar&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rfill&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rtxt&quot;&gt;02 Gated MLA&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;button class=&quot;rseg&quot; data-i=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rbar&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rfill&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rtxt&quot;&gt;03 Routing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;button class=&quot;rseg&quot; data-i=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rbar&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rfill&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rtxt&quot;&gt;04 FarSkip&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;button class=&quot;rseg&quot; data-i=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rbar&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rfill&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rtxt&quot;&gt;05 Result&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n &lt;/div&gt;\n\n &lt;div class=&quot;stage&quot;&gt;\n\n  &lt;div class=&quot;scene&quot; id=&quot;s0&quot;&gt;\n   &lt;div class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;PER TOKEN, PER LAYER&lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;div class=&quot;center&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;big&quot; id=&quot;n0&quot;&gt;16.0B&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;cap&quot; id=&quot;l0&quot;&gt;IF EVERY EXPERT RAN&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;blocks&quot; id=&quot;blk&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;cap&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:10px&quot;&gt;66 EXPERTS PER MoE LAYER &amp;mdash; 2 SHARED, 64 ROUTED&lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n  &lt;div class=&quot;scene&quot; id=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;\n   &lt;div class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;ATTENTION&lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;div class=&quot;flow&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;node&quot; id=&quot;f0&quot;&gt;TOKEN&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;arw&quot;&gt;&amp;rarr;&lt;/span&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;node&quot; id=&quot;f1&quot;&gt;MLA&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;arw&quot;&gt;&amp;rarr;&lt;/span&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;node&quot; id=&quot;f2&quot;&gt;GATE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;arw&quot;&gt;&amp;rarr;&lt;/span&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;node&quot; id=&quot;f3&quot;&gt;OUTPUT PROJ&lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;div class=&quot;heads&quot; id=&quot;heads&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sweep&quot; id=&quot;sweep&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;div class=&quot;cap&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center;margin-top:10px&quot;&gt;16 ATTENTION HEADS &amp;mdash; GATE APPLIED BEFORE OUTPUT PROJECTION&lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n  &lt;div class=&quot;scene&quot; id=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;\n   &lt;div class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;MoE LAYER&lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;div class=&quot;routewrap&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;track&quot;&gt;\n     &lt;div class=&quot;tok&quot; id=&quot;tk&quot;&gt;TOKEN&lt;/div&gt;\n     &lt;div class=&quot;rt&quot; id=&quot;rt&quot;&gt;ROUTER&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div&gt;\n     &lt;div class=&quot;g64&quot; id=&quot;g64&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n     &lt;div class=&quot;shrow&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;shx&quot; id=&quot;sh0&quot;&gt;SHARED 1&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;shx&quot; id=&quot;sh1&quot;&gt;SHARED 2&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;div class=&quot;cap&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center;margin-top:10px&quot;&gt;TOP-6 OF 64 ROUTED &amp;mdash; PLUS 2 SHARED, ALWAYS ON&lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n  &lt;div class=&quot;scene&quot; id=&quot;s3&quot;&gt;\n   &lt;div class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;EXPERT PARALLELISM&lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;div class=&quot;lane&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;lname&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Blocking all-to-all&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;t1&quot;&gt;0.00s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;lbar&quot;&gt;\n     &lt;div class=&quot;sg c1&quot; id=&quot;a1&quot;&gt;COMPUTE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sg c3&quot; id=&quot;a2&quot;&gt;STALL&lt;/div&gt;\n     &lt;div class=&quot;sg c2&quot; id=&quot;a3&quot;&gt;COMM&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sg c1&quot; id=&quot;a4&quot;&gt;COMPUTE&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;div class=&quot;lane&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;lname&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;FarSkip-Collective&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;t2&quot;&gt;0.00s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;lbar&quot;&gt;\n     &lt;div class=&quot;sg c1&quot; id=&quot;b1&quot;&gt;COMPUTE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sg c2&quot; id=&quot;b2&quot;&gt;COMM&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sg c1&quot; id=&quot;b3&quot;&gt;COMPUTE&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;gap:22px;justify-content:center;margin-top:14px&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;big&quot; style=&quot;font-size:24px&quot;&gt;12.7%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cap&quot;&gt;FASTER PRE-TRAINING&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;big&quot; style=&quot;font-size:24px&quot;&gt;39.2%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cap&quot;&gt;LOWER TTFT, SGLANG EP&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n  &lt;div class=&quot;scene&quot; id=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;\n   &lt;div class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;BASE, STANDARD BENCHMARKS&lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;div id=&quot;bars&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:26px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n   &lt;div class=&quot;cap&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;AVERAGE SCORE &amp;mdash; AMD-REPORTED&lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n &lt;/div&gt;\n\n &lt;div class=&quot;read&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;rnum&quot; id=&quot;rn&quot;&gt;ACT 01 / 05&lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;rttl&quot; id=&quot;rt2&quot;&gt;Sparse by design&lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;rbody&quot; id=&quot;rb&quot;&gt;A dense 16B model loads every parameter for every token. Instella-MoE wakes 8 experts out of 66, so each token costs 2.8B active parameters.&lt;/div&gt;\n &lt;/div&gt;\n\n &lt;div class=&quot;ctrls&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;button class=&quot;b&quot; id=&quot;pp&quot;&gt;Pause&lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;button class=&quot;b g&quot; id=&quot;pv&quot;&gt;Back&lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;button class=&quot;b g&quot; id=&quot;nx&quot;&gt;Next&lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;button class=&quot;b g&quot; id=&quot;rp&quot;&gt;Replay act&lt;/button&gt;\n &lt;/div&gt;\n\n &lt;div class=&quot;ft&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;span&gt;SOURCE: ROCM BLOG &amp;middot; HUGGING FACE &amp;middot; GITHUB &amp;middot; JULY 24, 2026&lt;/span&gt;\n  &lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;MARKTECHPOST&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;\n &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;script&gt;\n(function(){\n var COPY=[\n  [&quot;Sparse by design&quot;,&quot;A dense 16B model loads every parameter for every token. Instella-MoE wakes 8 experts out of 66, so each token costs 2.8B active parameters.&quot;],\n  [&quot;A gate mutes weak heads&quot;,&quot;A dedicated linear projection derives a gate from the input. It multiplies the MLA output before the output projection, attenuating low-utility responses.&quot;],\n  [&quot;The router picks six&quot;,&quot;Two shared experts fire for every token. The router then selects 6 routed experts from 64, independently at each of the 27 layers.&quot;],\n  [&quot;Communication hides under compute&quot;,&quot;Blocking all-to-all leaves GPUs stalled. FarSkip passes outdated and partial activations forward, so communication overlaps computation instead of waiting.&quot;],\n  [&quot;Where it lands&quot;,&quot;The base checkpoint averages 76.7, the strongest among fully open models. Qwen3.5-4B-Base, which is not fully open, still leads at 79.5.&quot;]\n ];\n var DUR=[7000,7500,8000,7500,7500];\n var i=0,playing=true,tmo=[],advance=null;\n var reduce=window.matchMedia&amp;&amp;window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n\n function T(f,ms){tmo.push(setTimeout(f,ms));}\n function clr(){tmo.forEach(clearTimeout);tmo=[];if(advance){clearTimeout(advance);advance=null;}}\n\n var blk=document.getElementById('blk');\n for(var a=0;a&lt;66;a++){var d=document.createElement('div');d.className='bk';blk.appendChild(d);}\n var heads=document.getElementById('heads'),hbs=[],rawh=[];\n for(var b=0;b&lt;16;b++){rawh.push(30+Math.round(Math.random()*62));var e=document.createElement('div');e.className='hb';heads.appendChild(e);hbs.push(e);}\n var g64=document.getElementById('g64');\n for(var c=0;c&lt;64;c++){var f=document.createElement('div');f.className='eg';g64.appendChild(f);}\n var DATA=[[&quot;Qwen3.5-4B-Base&quot;,79.5,0],[&quot;Instella-MoE-16B-A3B&quot;,76.7,1],[&quot;Moonlight-16B-A3B&quot;,76.2,0],[&quot;OLMo-3-7B&quot;,70.1,0],[&quot;OLMoE-1B-7B&quot;,61.9,0]];\n var bars=document.getElementById('bars');\n DATA.forEach(function(r){\n  var row=document.createElement('div');row.className='brow';\n  row.innerHTML='&lt;div class=&quot;bn&quot;&gt;'+r[0]+'&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bt&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bf'+(r[2]?' hero':'')+'&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bv&quot;&gt;'+r[1]+'&lt;/div&gt;';\n  bars.appendChild(row);\n });\n\n function count(el,from,to,ms,suf){\n  if(reduce){el.textContent=to.toFixed(suf==='B'?1:2)+suf;return;}\n  var t0=null;\n  function step(ts){if(!t0)t0=ts;var k=Math.min(1,(ts-t0)/ms);\n   el.textContent=(from+(to-from)*(1-Math.pow(1-k,3))).toFixed(suf==='B'?1:2)+suf;\n   if(k&lt;1)requestAnimationFrame(step);}\n  requestAnimationFrame(step);\n }\n\n var ACTS=[\n  function(){\n   var k=blk.children,pick={},n=0;\n   for(var x=0;x&lt;66;x++)k[x].className='bk';\n   T(function(){for(var x=0;x&lt;66;x++)k[x].className='bk hot';},250);\n   document.getElementById('n0').textContent='16.0B';\n   document.getElementById('l0').textContent='IF EVERY EXPERT RAN';\n   T(function(){\n    while(n&lt;6){var r=2+Math.floor(Math.random()*64);if(!pick[r]){pick[r]=1;n++;}}\n    pick[0]=1;pick[1]=1;\n    for(var x=0;x&lt;66;x++)k[x].className=pick[x]?'bk act':'bk';\n    document.getElementById('l0').textContent='ACTIVE PER TOKEN';\n    count(document.getElementById('n0'),16,2.8,900,'B');\n   },2200);\n  },\n  function(){\n   ['f0','f1','f2','f3'].forEach(function(id){document.getElementById(id).className='node';});\n   hbs.forEach(function(h){h.className='hb';h.style.height='4%';});\n   document.getElementById('sweep').className='sweep';\n   T(function(){document.getElementById('f0').className='node lit';},200);\n   T(function(){\n    document.getElementById('f1').className='node lit';\n    hbs.forEach(function(h,j){T(function(){h.style.height=rawh[j]+'%';},j*45);});\n   },700);\n   T(function(){\n    document.getElementById('f2').className='node lit';\n    document.getElementById('sweep').className='sweep go';\n    hbs.forEach(function(h,j){\n     T(function(){var g=0.25+0.7*Math.abs(Math.sin(j*1.9));h.className='hb gd';h.style.height=Math.max(4,rawh[j]*g)+'%';},250+j*128);\n    });\n   },1900);\n   T(function(){document.getElementById('f3').className='node lit';},4400);\n  },\n  function(){\n   var k=g64.children,pick={},n=0;\n   for(var x=0;x&lt;64;x++)k[x].className='eg';\n   document.getElementById('tk').className='tok';\n   document.getElementById('rt').className='rt';\n   document.getElementById('sh0').className='shx';document.getElementById('sh1').className='shx';\n   T(function(){document.getElementById('tk').className='tok in';},250);\n   T(function(){document.getElementById('rt').className='rt lit';},1000);\n   T(function(){document.getElementById('sh0').className='shx on';document.getElementById('sh1').className='shx on';},1500);\n   T(function(){\n    while(n&lt;6){var r=Math.floor(Math.random()*64);if(!pick[r]){pick[r]=1;n++;}}\n    Object.keys(pick).forEach(function(idx,j){T(function(){k[idx].className='eg fire';},j*230);});\n   },1900);\n  },\n  function(){\n   var A=['a1','a2','a3','a4'],AW=[30,20,20,30],B=['b1','b2','b3'],BW=[46,14,40];\n   A.forEach(function(id){document.getElementById(id).style.width='0';});\n   B.forEach(function(id){document.getElementById(id).style.width='0';});\n   document.getElementById('t1').textContent='0.00s';document.getElementById('t2').textContent='0.00s';\n   var d=0;A.forEach(function(id,j){T(function(){document.getElementById(id).style.width=AW[j]+'%';},400+d);d+=AW[j]*22;});\n   var d2=0;B.forEach(function(id,j){T(function(){document.getElementById(id).style.width=BW[j]+'%';},400+d2);d2+=BW[j]*19.2;});\n   T(function(){count(document.getElementById('t1'),0,1.00,2200,'s');},400);\n   T(function(){count(document.getElementById('t2'),0,0.87,1920,'s');},400);\n  },\n  function(){\n   var f=bars.querySelectorAll('.bf');\n   for(var x=0;x&lt;f.length;x++)f[x].style.width='0';\n   DATA.forEach(function(r,j){T(function(){f[j].style.width=(r[1]/85*100)+'%';},250+j*160);});\n  }\n ];\n\n function show(n){\n  clr();\n  i=(n+5)%5;\n  for(var x=0;x&lt;5;x++){\n   document.getElementById('s'+x).className='scene'+(x===i?' on':'');\n   var seg=document.querySelectorAll('.rseg')[x];\n   seg.className='rseg'+(x&lt;i?' done':'')+(x===i?' now':'')+((x===i&amp;&amp;!playing)?' hold':'');\n   seg.style.setProperty('--d',DUR[x]+'ms');\n  }\n  document.getElementById('rn').textContent='ACT 0'+(i+1)+' / 05';\n  document.getElementById('rt2').textContent=COPY[i][0];\n  document.getElementById('rb').textContent=COPY[i][1];\n  ACTS[i]();\n  if(playing&amp;&amp;!reduce)advance=setTimeout(function(){show(i+1);},DUR[i]);\n }\n\n document.getElementById('pp').onclick=function(){\n  playing=!playing;this.textContent=playing?'Pause':'Play';\n  if(playing){show(i);}else{clr();document.querySelectorAll('.rseg')[i].className='rseg now hold';}\n };\n document.getElementById('nx').onclick=function(){playing=false;document.getElementById('pp').textContent='Play';show(i+1);};\n document.getElementById('pv').onclick=function(){playing=false;document.getElementById('pp').textContent='Play';show(i-1);};\n document.getElementById('rp').onclick=function(){show(i);};\n var segs=document.querySelectorAll('.rseg');\n for(var q=0;q&lt;segs.length;q++){\n  segs[q].onclick=function(){playing=false;document.getElementById('pp').textContent='Play';show(+this.getAttribute('data-i'));};\n }\n if(reduce){playing=false;document.getElementById('pp').textContent='Play';}\n show(0);\n\n function size(){parent.postMessage({mtpFrame:'instella-moe',height:document.body.offsetHeight+40},'*');}\n window.addEventListener('load',size);window.addEventListener('resize',size);\n setTimeout(size,300);setTimeout(size,1200);\n})();\n&lt;/script&gt;\n\"></iframe>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-key-takeaways\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></h2>\n  <ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n   <li>16B total parameters, 2.8B active per token: 2 shared plus 6 of 64 routed experts.</li>\n   <li>Gated MLA and FarSkip-Collective give a 12.7% training speedup and 39.2% lower TTFT.</li>\n   <li>Trained end-to-end on AMD Instinct MI300X and MI325X with ROCm, Primus, and Miles.</li>\n   <li>Base averages 76.7 and Think averages 73.22, both leading fully open peers.</li>\n   <li>ResearchRAIL weights limit commercial use; the MIT-licensed training code does not.</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Check out the<strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rocm.blogs.amd.com/artificial-intelligence/instella-moe/README.html\">ROCm blog</a>, <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/collections/amd/instella-moe\">Hugging Face collection</a> </strong>and<strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/AMD-AGI/Instella-MoE\">GitHub</a>.&nbsp;</strong>Also,&nbsp;feel free to follow us on&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://x.com/intent/follow?screen_name=marktechpost\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark>Twitter</mark></a></strong>&nbsp;and don’t forget to join our&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/machinelearningnews/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">150k+ML SubReddit</a></strong>&nbsp;and Subscribe to&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.aidevsignals.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">our Newsletter</a></strong>. Wait! are you on telegram?&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://t.me/machinelearningresearchnews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">now you can join us on telegram as well.</a></strong></p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Need to partner with us for promoting your GitHub Repo OR Hugging Face Page OR Product Release OR Webinar etc.?&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://forms.gle/wbash1wF6efRj8G58\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark>Connect with us</mark></a></strong></p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href=\"https://rocm.blogs.amd.com/artificial-intelligence/instella-moe/README.html\">ROCm blog</a> · <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/collections/amd/instella-moe\">Hugging Face collection</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/AMD-AGI/Instella-MoE\">GitHub</a></p>\n  <!-- MOLONGUI AUTHORSHIP PLUGIN 5.2.9 -->\n  <!-- https://www.molongui.com/wordpress-plugin-post-authors -->\n  <div class=\"m-a-box \" data-box-layout=\"slim\" data-box-position=\"below\" data-multiauthor=\"false\" data-author-id=\"1\" data-author-type=\"user\" data-author-archived=\"\">\n   <div class=\"m-a-box-container\">\n    <div class=\"m-a-box-tab m-a-box-content m-a-box-profile\" data-profile-layout=\"layout-1\" data-author-ref=\"user-1\" itemscope itemid=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/author/6flvq/\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Person\">\n     <div class=\"m-a-box-content-middle\">\n      <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-avatar\" data-source=\"local\">\n       <a class=\"m-a-box-avatar-url\" href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/author/6flvq/\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-150x150.png\" class=\"avatar avatar-150 photo\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-150x150.png 150w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-80x80.png 80w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-24x24.png 24w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-48x48.png 48w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-96x96.png 96w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-300x300.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" data-attachment-id=\"17663\" data-permalink=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/?attachment_id=17663\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM.png\" data-orig-size=\"832,778\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Screen Shot 2021-09-14 at 9.02.24 AM\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM.png\"></a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-data\">\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-name\">\n        <h5 itemprop=\"name\"><a class=\"m-a-box-name-url \" href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/author/6flvq/\" itemprop=\"url\"> Asif Razzaq</a></h5>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-meta\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"m-a-box-string-web\">Website</span></a>&nbsp;<span class=\"m-a-box-meta-divider\">|</span>&nbsp; <a href=\"#\" class=\"m-a-box-data-toggle\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span class=\"m-a-box-string-more-posts\">+ posts</span></a>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-bio\" itemprop=\"description\">\n        <p>Asif Razzaq is the CEO of Marktechpost Media Inc.. As a visionary entrepreneur and engineer, Asif is committed to harnessing the potential of Artificial Intelligence for social good. His most recent endeavor is the launch of an Artificial Intelligence Media Platform, Marktechpost, which stands out for its in-depth coverage of machine learning and deep learning news that is both technically sound and easily understandable by a wide audience. The platform boasts of over 2 million monthly views, illustrating its popularity among audiences.</p>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-related\" data-related-layout=\"layout-1\"></div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- CONTENT END 2 -->\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "AMD 发布 Instella-MoE-16B-A3B，一个完全开源的混合专家大语言模型，拥有 16B 总参数和每个 token 2.8B 活跃参数，基于 Instinct GPU 训练，并采用了新颖的架构与训练优化。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "AMD 发布 Instella-MoE-16B-A3B，一个完全开源的混合专家大语言模型，拥有 16B 总参数和每个 token 2.8B 活跃参数，基于 Instinct GPU 训练，并采用了新颖的架构与训练优化。",
  "summary": "AMD 推出了 Instella-MoE-16B-A3B，一个开源的 MoE 语言模型，拥有 16B 总参数和每个 token 2.8B 活跃参数。该模型采用了多项架构创新，如门控多头潜在注意力和 FarSkip-Collective 连接，实现了 12.7% 的训练加速和 39.2% 的首 token 延迟降低。模型在 AMD Instinct GPU 上进行了端到端训练，使用了包括 Nemotron-CC-v2 和 Dolma3 数据集在内的多样化数据混合。该模型以 ResearchRAIL 许可证发布，仅限非商业用途，训练代码采用 MIT 许可证。评估显示，该模型在 WinoGrande（86.5）和 HumanEval+（65.7）等基准测试中表现出色，性能可与 Moonlight-16B-A3B 和 SmolLM3-3B 等开源模型相媲美。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "Instella-MoE-16B-A3B 采用新颖的 MoE 架构，每层包含 2 个共享专家和 6 个路由专家。",
      "explanation": "这种配置使得 16B 总参数中仅有 2.8B 活跃参数，在保持性能的同时优化了计算效率。"
    },
